{"__lines":{"You were born to no one. No town wrote down your name, and no temple kept your birth. As far as Caldris is concerned, you were never here.":"in_n8","Except to the Debt Collectors. They found your father\u2019s name in their Ledger, a loan against his Sheaf, and in Caldris debts pass down. Every year since he died, they have taken pages from you.":"in_n9","The Lodge pays its Hunters in Relic shards, and the Collectors accept shards. It is the only work that pays enough. So you came.":"in_n10","Your father\u2019s line, paid with your pages. They never check whose Sheaf they\u2019re cutting. They just collect.":"in_i7","Her people have taken pages from you every year since you were a child. And you were never even in her book.":"pn_1","Twelve years of mornings you will never have. For a man you barely remember, and a loan you never signed.":"pn_2","So you never owed them anything. Not one page.":"pn_3","You take her hand. You have paid for nothing your whole life. You might as well fight for something.":"pn_4","Your father\u2019s page is in here too. The one you have been paying for.":"pn_5","Two pages burn tonight. Hers, and the one with your father\u2019s name on it.":"pn_6","All your life you paid for a line you never wrote. Now you get to write one.":"pn_7","Nothing is owed. Not by you. Not by anyone.":"pn_8","You have been paying the Tithe your whole life. This time, you fight back.":"pn_9","You have knelt to Collectors your whole life. You will not kneel to her.":"pn_10"},"in_n8":"img/x/582e47ef91147891.mp3","in_n9":"img/x/ecf0cbadd493a2a7.mp3","in_n10":"img/x/ebe8dda2d494f737.mp3","in_i7":"img/x/d57e9395404c5952.mp3","pn_1":"img/x/94e75c740692a7b8.mp3","pn_2":"img/x/a8e1ca138b92ef8a.mp3","pn_3":"img/x/1a2fa9e0c97fb445.mp3","pn_4":"img/x/8fa01799fa9ba196.mp3","pn_5":"img/x/464b4bc6a227fefb.mp3","pn_6":"img/x/c39ed1c86202feb3.mp3","pn_7":"img/x/7cecde8a807b6b23.mp3","pn_8":"img/x/ceb782c559ee412e.mp3","pn_9":"img/x/1a958563f781f4b2.mp3","pn_10":"img/x/5bf8de431a6160cf.mp3"}